cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cybara in your research or project, please cite it as below."
title: "Cybara: An open-source multi-agent AI platform (CLI, web, and desktop)"
abstract: >-
  Cybara is an open-source, local-first AI agent platform with a CLI, web UI, and desktop apps.
  It ships 71 built-in tools, 50 LLM provider integrations, 7 channel adapters, a multi-agent
  runtime with subagent spawning, MCP host and client support, media generation, desktop control,
  a multi-agent kanban orchestration tier, encrypted wallet automation, and execution sandboxing.
  Built on Bun + TypeScript + Tauri.
